<li id="S5.I4.ix1" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">1</span> 
<div id="S5.I4.ix1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S5.I4.ix1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">The ‘ws’ refers to the weighted sampling strategy.</p>
</div></li>
